    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "New to the market, 65 The Willows is a well-presented three-bedroom semi-detached residence situated in one of Carlow's most popular and established residential developments.\r\n\r\nIdeally located within walking distance of Sandhills Shopping Centre, SuperValu, local primary and secondary schools, and a host of everyday amenities, the property also benefits from easy access to the Hacketstown Road. The M9 Motorway is approximately 8km away, while Carlow Town Centre can be reached in just five minutes.\r\n\r\nBuilt in 1999 and extending to approximately 99 sq.m. (1,065 sq.ft.), this attractive home offers well-proportioned accommodation throughout, complemented by an enclosed rear garden, side access, and off-street parking.\r\n\r\nUpon entering, a welcoming hallway leads to a bright and spacious living room featuring elegant coving and cornicing, timber flooring, and a bay window that fills the room with natural light while providing pleasant views of the surrounding neighbourhood. Additional storage is available beneath the staircase.\r\n\r\nTo the rear, the kitchen and dining area offers an abundance of fitted units and storage space, while patio doors provide direct access to the private rear garden, creating an ideal setting for family living and entertaining.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, there are three generously sized bedrooms, all benefiting from timber flooring and excellent natural light. The master bedroom features built-in wardrobes, providing practical and ample storage. A family bathroom with white sanitary ware and a hot press completes the first-floor accommodation.\r\n\r\nOffering immense potential for a new owner to create a home of their own, 65 The Willows is an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, growing families, or those seeking a well-located property in a mature residential setting."
      },
      {
